<title>MONACO: SWIMMING-CHINA'S CAI SETS WORLD BEST IN 50 METRES BUTTERFLY.</title>
<headline>SWIMMING-CHINA'S CAI SETS WORLD BEST IN 50 METRES BUTTERFLY.</headline>
<dateline>MONACO 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cai Huijue of China swam a world best time of 27.26 seconds in the women's 50 metres butterfly at the Monaco International meeting on Saturday.</p>
<p>Cai improved on the previous world best of 27.30 seconds set by compatriot Hong Qian in Perth, Australia in January 1991.</p>
</text>
